      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of being a ghost is a natural part of the transition from active service to reflective rest. You are not a leftover shell, but a person who has completed a chapter and is now preparing to write another. The mirror may not show the same face, but it will show the same heart that has been shaped by your thirty years of service. This is not the end, but a new beginning where you can be useful again, not as a savior, but as a guide for your own life.",
      "source": "target",
